    changePath()
changePathPath
PathchangePath

changePath ( $filesToScan,  $rootPath = null
)[static]

Replaces old path references with new path references in the specified files.





Parameters










array$filesToScan

Array of file paths to scan and modify. 




string | null$rootPath

The new root path to replace the old one. If null, uses a default root path. 







                Returns


array Returns an array with the count of occurrences changed and the count of files changed. 




